# Session Memory — archived 2026-08-29

This skill wrote session reasoning to the global `.workspace/STATE.md` Log and audience-level
`CONTINUE_HERE.md`. That split ownership from the Linear Project and made multiple invocations
reconstruct different current state.

Live responsibilities now belong to `$workspace`, backed by the shared Project snapshot protocol:

- Project-local `projects/<project>/CONTINUE_HERE.md`
- Project-local `projects/<project>/STATE.md` → `## Feature log`
- exact proposed writes, approved and applied serially
- a fresh post-write snapshot fingerprint

This file intentionally uses the `.archived` suffix so installers cannot discover it.
